# 🤖 RAG Chatbot

A Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) chatbot that allows users to ask questions about provided documents and generate answers using retrieved document context and a Large Language Model.

The project combines a **Next.js frontend** and **Flask RAG backend** into a **single Docker container**, making deployment easier on platforms such as Render.

---
live Demo 🚀
https://rag-chatbot-ost8.onrender.com
## 🚀 Features

- 💬 Interactive AI chatbot interface
- 📄 Document-based question answering
- 🔎 Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)
- 🧠 Hugging Face LLM integration
- 🔢 Hugging Face embedding API
- 🗄️ ChromaDB vector database
- ⚡ Flask REST API
- ⚛️ Next.js frontend
- 🐳 Single Docker container deployment
- 🔐 Environment-variable based API key management
- ☁️ Ready for cloud deployment

