💻 Local Development
1. Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/subashvelmurugan1408/RAG_Chatbot.git
cd RAG_Chatbot
2. Backend setup

Create a Python virtual environment:

python -m venv venv

Activate it on Windows:

venv\Scripts\activate

Install backend dependencies:

pip install -r backend/requirements.txt
3. Frontend setup

Go to the frontend directory:

cd frontend

Install dependencies:

npm install

Return to the project root:

cd ..
🐳 Run With Docker

The recommended way to run the complete application is Docker.

Build the Docker image

From the project root:

docker build -t rag-chatbot .
Run the container
docker run --env-file backend/.env -p 3000:3000 rag-chatbot

Open the application:

http://localhost:3000
🔍 Check Running Container
docker ps

View container logs:

docker logs -f rag-chatbot

Run the container in the background:

docker run -d \
  --name rag-chatbot \
  --env-file backend/.env \
  -p 3000:3000 \
  rag-chatbot

Stop the container:

docker stop rag-chatbot

Remove the container:

docker rm rag-chatbot
